CM_ SG_ 2364539738 Actual_Maximum_Available_Engine_Percent_Torque "This is the maximum amount of torque that the engine can immediately deliver as a percentage of the reference engine torque (SPN 544).  The Actual Maximum Available Engine - Percent Torque shall take into consideration all engine torque derates (e.g. air fuel ratio control (AFC), noise control, etc.) that could potentially be active in the system.  This parameter differentiates itself from the engine percent torque points 1 through 5 of the engine configuration map because it takes into account all dynamic internal inputs such as  AFC and that it is updated on a 50ms basis.";
