CM_ SG_ 2349075290 XBR_Message_Counter "The XBR message counter is to verify the signal path from the demanding device to the brake controller on electronicbrake systems.. The support of this parameter is mandatory.";
CM_ SG_ 2349075290 XBR_Message_Checksum "The XBR message checksum is used to verify the signal path from the demanding device to the brake controller on electronic brake systems. The support of this parameter is mandatory if PGN 1024 is supported as there is no means to indicate “not available”.";
